{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "When I was in middle school and high school, my parents didn’t allow me to drink soda.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f4d254de78bb5619027d271759ec696b4c969313a410b2b644a6e326cd2b35d0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.64], [4, 0.64, 0.82], [5, 0.82, 1.14], [6, 1.14, 1.42], [7, 1.42, 1.62], [8, 1.62, 2.02], [9, 2.44, 2.54], [10, 2.54, 2.86], [11, 2.86, 3.22], [12, 3.22, 3.48], [13, 3.48, 3.68], [14, 3.68, 3.82], [15, 3.82, 4.02], [16, 4.02, 4.36]]}, {"text": "But they had a secret stash of Coca-Cola in the garage fridge.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3868f42e61889b7e66c0b80c85c6581d0da40e1a50f08a013407ae6eb73cfddb.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.42], [3, 0.42, 0.5], [4, 0.5, 0.8], [5, 0.8, 1.22], [6, 1.22, 1.36], [8, 1.78, 2.0], [9, 2.0, 2.08], [10, 2.08, 2.4], [11, 2.4, 2.72]]}, {"text": "I still don’t know why it was there.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1a45f2b444e5992bd010d8fb8500f1f40d8d8ab8a6f22f7d7265bada86b37d60.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.76], [4, 0.76, 0.98], [5, 0.98, 1.12], [6, 1.12, 1.26], [7, 1.26, 1.48]]}, {"text": "My parents didn’t drink soda.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/89bf18c1a53eb9a2fce3a522a97c4d2ced8fc87a91a7af8458a686c2cba3370d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.94], [3, 0.94, 1.18], [4, 1.18, 1.54]]}, {"text": "Maybe it was for guests.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5e36f359fd24ec378e675a2900d4737d0065391f959b91392dc5df476c43fc20.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.68], [4, 0.68, 0.98]]}, {"text": "Maybe it was just inertia.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/0b8fb86cf47134ed525b805b6eace28e6bb5275c26af5906784457cfdfd8feec.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.64], [3, 0.64, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.28]]}, {"text": "But I knew it existed and that was enough.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f6ceb483267b18dd26e9542a7f03e2221961ee960bf7d5a2b54b1dc833246232.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [2, 0.3, 0.38], [3, 0.38, 0.48], [4, 0.48, 0.84], [5, 0.84, 1.38], [6, 1.38, 1.54], [7, 1.54, 1.7], [8, 1.7, 1.92]]}, {"text": "Whenever I was stressed about school or upset at them, I’d sneak into the garage and take a sip out of one of the 20oz bottles.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2b0aaaa058947138ebccd23e5804a2d5db64a3782b134c041a866e04f111e33d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.58], [2, 0.58, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.02], [4, 1.02, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.72], [6, 1.72, 2.06], [7, 2.06, 2.36], [8, 2.36, 2.54], [9, 2.54, 2.78], [10, 3.26, 3.4], [11, 3.4, 3.6], [12, 3.6, 3.88], [13, 3.88, 4.02], [14, 4.02, 4.28], [15, 4.28, 4.6], [16, 4.6, 4.78], [17, 4.78, 4.9], [18, 4.9, 5.14], [19, 5.14, 5.36], [20, 5.36, 5.46], [21, 5.46, 5.58], [22, 5.58, 5.68], [23, 5.68, 5.8], [25, 6.32, 6.68]]}, {"text": "That sip wasn’t about the soda.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3ec6c57ad4e0c1e23baeca89e5058842b595b567d7bac8054078b31fd8a694bb.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [2, 0.58, 1.02], [3, 1.02, 1.24], [4, 1.24, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.72]]}, {"text": "It was about rebellion.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4df78dd28f215dd3da6811a6af6b4ced57431c2a0494dbd226ac9e770126fd10.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 1.26]]}, {"text": "Self-soothing.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/43c7c4b538384dbf8d5342f0fdd053680a252a662468e68af2bc7a98f5e58b8a.mp3"}, {"text": "Control.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a41271c371ec9fda7dae0d8b6d19fa1690556d1777f02bb7543f1250228b585a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36]]}, {"text": "It was a quiet “f you” to rules I didn’t agree with, and a small moment of calm in the garage when I needed it.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d3afc8db888d3f34c091c0e4de3ebe197a88d3a92dc14c656690254bf2e3a821.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.48], [3, 0.48, 0.86], [6, 1.24, 1.76], [9, 2.28, 2.52], [10, 2.52, 2.78], [11, 2.78, 3.18], [12, 3.46, 3.64], [13, 3.64, 3.72], [14, 3.72, 4.0], [15, 4.0, 4.32], [16, 4.32, 4.52], [17, 4.52, 4.78], [18, 4.78, 4.96], [19, 4.96, 5.06], [20, 5.06, 5.34], [21, 5.34, 5.7], [22, 5.7, 5.84], [23, 5.84, 6.06], [24, 6.06, 6.3]]}, {"text": "Today, I’m an adult.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f7eec0b2a2efbc7426dc51f4bd2b86cb3fac2ad0f96075a4686ff1240ecb66e2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.76], [2, 0.76, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.14]]}, {"text": "I have adult money.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/417564239cdc197ce2b8b35c6453c93d4eda16b058c12c4edfd42a25adc03dd8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.62], [3, 0.62, 1.0]]}, {"text": "I can buy soda whenever I want.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/09a78beafec3c4f09be9c31ee10a5698b8974cbf0f330387c85b5bf35d892493.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.48], [3, 0.48, 0.84], [4, 0.84, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.66], [6, 1.66, 1.96]]}, {"text": "And because of that, soda means nothing to me now.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c3d8843bb5ebb2fcec619ee9534f0a891705784b7b47a1146a403ce7b45e8969.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.84], [4, 1.14, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.78], [7, 1.78, 1.98], [8, 1.98, 2.1], [9, 2.1, 2.28]]}, {"text": "Scarcity creates anticipation", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/785c09dd2d478f24054a2b468cb7016d1457a7d0a8767954274d901b6d1379e6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.54], [1, 0.54, 0.96], [2, 0.96, 1.7]]}, {"text": "Anticipation amplifies experience", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ecfe30284610cbb651425e19a6553bd1d19674655f62343fc36c43ce2d3c6f53.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.62], [1, 0.62, 1.38], [2, 1.38, 1.98]]}, {"text": "Unlimited access removes anticipation", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6c83b383c38352e61b593a96f6369c2864ef0f702232e55d6269ee6424297e44.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.44], [1, 0.44, 0.82], [2, 0.82, 1.22], [3, 1.22, 1.78]]}, {"text": "Without anticipation, pleasure decays into habit", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/fed3be040297fd45e88bc2043c29635af56545db4dcb13053d810dbcf0c4fc05.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.86], [2, 1.56, 1.82], [3, 1.82, 2.26], [4, 2.26, 2.44], [5, 2.44, 2.78]]}, {"text": "Standing in an immigration line in Vietnam last week, I realized something uncomfortable: this was a Tuesday for me.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5e4377162912e1eda07fb96a02e69e9929e80b23225bcf6b2ba03e3d07a6d0e1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 2.18], [8, 2.18, 2.46], [9, 2.76, 2.88], [10, 2.88, 3.12], [11, 3.12, 3.5], [12, 3.5, 4.06], [13, 4.42, 4.58], [14, 4.58, 4.7], [15, 4.7, 4.82], [16, 4.82, 5.04], [17, 5.04, 5.34], [18, 5.34, 5.5]]}, {"text": "For the people around me, this was a once-in-a-lifetime moment.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/26b52e82ac065fefcffc99d66b818a596dcf3fc90677b4d5006cd54acf1ff8f9.mp3"}, {"text": "First time in Asia.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c63c6dc5db9cbb0182acadc2d80e8b4e16d665a0a2471ecc7b18a8c7bc199964.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 1.0]]}, {"text": "First time in Vietnam.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3c8728780e173642c02454504bc90979a38f52f44560ceae997e5f60d38aeb7a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.2]]}, {"text": "Something they’d talk about for years.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c8faf807a0375c5b61f0546b2ee23c827ca1bf42771f38fc8f6c1fbc790cff42.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.42], [2, 0.62, 0.82], [3, 0.82, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.34], [5, 1.34, 1.64]]}, {"text": "I missed that uncertainty, that joy, the nervousness traveling to a new country.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/44702245a333a461d63a730863484da6ed7a6d13927d9bd9dfbc56748d61c92e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [2, 0.4, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 1.14], [4, 1.66, 1.8], [5, 1.8, 2.26], [6, 2.78, 3.0], [7, 3.0, 3.56], [8, 3.56, 4.0], [9, 4.0, 4.24], [10, 4.24, 4.32], [11, 4.32, 4.44], [12, 4.44, 4.8]]}, {"text": "At this point, I’ve visited 60 countries in the world.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/35744a03f1b252940c134ea65ad11e96d7b3b97a3a2af00eaff5d545b7faeea3.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.52], [4, 0.7, 1.02], [5, 1.02, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.86], [7, 1.86, 2.04], [8, 2.04, 2.14], [9, 2.14, 2.38]]}, {"text": "I’ve had that ‘new country experience’ 59 times in my life and that novelty is waning.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7a10f98e93c72e3d8e42e08cf914827ba2b5bed9550872a329d523742cfbeeda.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.68], [6, 1.68, 2.3], [7, 2.3, 2.8], [8, 2.8, 2.9], [9, 2.9, 3.02], [10, 3.02, 3.46], [12, 4.02, 4.18], [13, 4.18, 4.52], [14, 4.52, 4.76], [15, 4.76, 5.02]]}, {"text": "I don’t think happiness comes from adding more things.", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/87787691b7b83108ba90a0c427e373511b31a074c9c0d1dcf8ef6b8429f41aac.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.4], [3, 0.4, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.2], [5, 1.2, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 2.0], [8, 2.0, 2.34]]}, {"text": "I think it comes from protecting the things that still feel special.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4ff725520789f7d9ca8c65422dc1e4d271f85f4bd8575d6473638c44f8c2fffd.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.68], [4, 0.68, 0.9], [5, 0.9, 1.32], [6, 1.32, 1.52], [7, 1.52, 1.74], [8, 1.74, 1.94], [9, 1.94, 2.18], [10, 2.18, 2.38], [11, 2.38, 2.8]]}, {"text": "So this year, I’m not trying to upgrade my life, introducing new luxuries to post about on IG of Threads.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/522f9d53087bf49905335d66bf3447716794ceaec93953ce4754fbe10cf6de71.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.58], [3, 1.04, 1.18], [4, 1.18, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.76], [7, 1.76, 2.06], [8, 2.06, 2.3], [9, 2.3, 2.74], [10, 3.14, 3.46], [11, 3.46, 3.88], [12, 3.88, 4.34], [13, 4.34, 4.62], [14, 4.62, 4.88], [15, 4.88, 5.16], [16, 5.16, 5.46], [17, 5.46, 5.78], [18, 5.78, 5.98], [19, 5.98, 6.22]]}, {"text": "Instead, in 2026 I want to restore contrast.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5477495772b00d410cd3822b8ea243396ce30cf6b105478cd1938f9ea245c19e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.42], [1, 0.5, 0.64], [2, 0.64, 1.34], [3, 1.34, 1.56], [4, 1.56, 1.74], [5, 1.74, 1.9], [6, 1.9, 2.16], [7, 2.16, 2.64]]}]}